px #F0F0F0 solid; padding:0px 4px 0px 4px\" class=\"hierarchy\">Definition: <a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/diagnosticreport.html#DiagnosticReport.conclusion\">DiagnosticReport.conclusion</a></td></tr>#xD;\n<tr><td colspan=\"5\" class=\"hierarchy\"><br/><a href=\"https://hl7.org/fhir/R4/formats.html#table\" title=\"Legend for this format\"><img src=\"data:image/png;base64,\" alt=\"doco\" style=\"background-color: inherit\"/> Documentation for this format</a></td></tr></table><hr/><p><b>Options Sets</b></p><a name=\"opt-item.A1_MedicationStorage\"> </a><p><b>Answer options for A1_MedicationStorage </b></p><ul><li style=\"font-size: 11px\">http://snomed.info/sct#710977001 (\"Safe storage and management of medication\")</li><li style=\"font-size: 11px\">http://snomed.info/sct#424363005 (\"Improper storage of medication\")</li></ul><a name=\"opt-item.B1_MedicationFullyDissolved\"> </a><p><b>Answer options for B1_MedicationFullyDissolved </b></p><ul><li style=\"font-size: 11px\">http://snomed.info/sct#373066001 (\"Yes (qualifier value)\")</li><li style=\"font-size: 11px\">http://snomed.info/sct#373067005 (\"No (qualifier value)\")</li></ul><a name=\"opt-item.C1_AdministrationCorrect\"> </a><p><b>Answer options for C1_AdministrationCorrect </b></p><ul><li style=\"font-size: 11px\">http://snomed.info/sct#373066001 (\"Yes (qualifier value)\")</li><li style=\"font-size: 11px\">http://snomed.info/sct#373067005 (\"No (qualifier value)\")</li></ul><a name=\"opt-item.E1_DressingObservation\"> </a><p><b>Answer options for E1_DressingObservation </b></p><ul><li style=\"font-size: 11px\">http://snomed.info/sct#17621005 (\"Normal (qualifier value)\")</li><li style=\"font-size: 11px\">http://snomed.info/sct#263654008 (\"Abnormal (qualifier value)\")</li></ul><a name=\"opt-item.E3_Bloody\"> </a><p><b>Answer options for E3_Bloody </b></p><ul><li style=\"font-size: 11px\">http://snomed.info/sct#373066001 (\"Yes (qualifier value)\")</li><li style=\"font-size: 11px\">http://snomed.info/s